    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***APPLY VIA EMAIL ONLY***\r\nRE/MAX Property Specialists are delighted to present 7 Kenure Court, Powerscourt to the market.\r\n\r\nNumber 7 Kenure Court is a bright and spacious three bedroom bungalow enjoying a pleasant position within the well-established Powerscourt development. Powerscourt is ideally located just off the Dunmore Road, within easy reach of University Hospital Waterford and Waterford City Centre. Accommodation includes an entrance hall, a comfortable living area/sitting room, kitchen, three generous bedrooms and a main bathroom. The property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout and is ideally suited to those seeking a comfortable home in a convenient residential location. This property is on a range of bus routes and within walking distance to an array of shops restaurants schools and colleges.\r\nNo Pets"
      }
